#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#This example dataset has been included in past versions of CarSim as part of some examples using a legacy brake system screen that had custom controls to support a "Type A" and "Type B" external ABS controller.
#
#The "Type B" controller handles pressure after proportioning.
#
#All options for configuring the brake system within CarSim are now handled by the standard 4W brake screens, and legacy datasets work as intended for setting up the built-in options.
#
#However, the link to the external Simulink model has been modified for the 2017 version with repect to the Import variables. See the linked Import dataset for details of the change.
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

